(text "PICO 2 / RP2350 — ROM INTERFACE" (at 20 15 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4579038c-6e4a-5c1a-b9a4-bb2b0fb55b1a"))
(text "3.3V B-side signals have P_ prefix. All CPC-facing GPIOs use level translation.\nInput switches enable when CPC 5V is present; JP2 separately isolates the data bus and controls ROMDIS." (at 20 32 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "255c8922-3a96-5150-a00a-1c06f11186f5"))
(text "Native RP2350 monitor: keep JP2 open.\nROM-serving firmware and timing remain to be validated." (at 284 145 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "00d50dd9-215b-5142-bfb2-20f2dcddd849"))
(text "U4-U7 each require local 100nF. GPIO0/1 are address inputs: UART stdio must stay disabled." (at 20 228 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "555abe63-48eb-5ae5-8964-db8e473aee96"))
